{"id": "section-body-00878", "title": "Anaphylaxis", "chapterId": "chapter-one", "blocks": [{"id": "body-00878", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Anaphylaxis", "runs": [{"text": "Anaphylaxis"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-00879", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Anaphylaxis is a severe, life-threatening, generalized or systemic hypersensitivity reaction characterized by rapidly developing life-threatening airway (pharyngeal or laryngeal edema) and/or breathing (bronchospasm and tachypnea) and/or circulation (hypotension and tachycardia) problems usually associated with skin and mucosal changes.", "runs": [{"text": "Anaphylaxis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "severe,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "life-threatening,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "generalized"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "systemic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hypersensitivity"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "reaction"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "characterized"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "by"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "rapidly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "developing life-threatening airway (pharyngeal or laryngeal edema) and/or breathing (bronchospasm and tachypnea) and/or circulation (hypotension and tachycardia) problems usually associated with skin and mucosal changes."}]}, {"id": "body-00880", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-00881", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Hives", "runs": [{"text": "Hives"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1871"}}, {"id": "body-00882", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Angioedema", "runs": [{"text": "Angioedema"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1871"}}, {"id": "body-00883", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Wheezes", "runs": [{"text": "Wheezes"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1871"}}, {"id": "body-00884", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Difficult breathing", "runs": [{"text": "Difficult"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "breathing"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1871"}}, {"id": "body-00885", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Diarrhea", "runs": [{"text": "Diarrhea"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1871"}}, {"id": "body-00886", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Hypotension", "runs": [{"text": "Hypotension"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1871"}}, {"id": "body-00888", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Anaphylaxis is a clinical diagnosis and should be suspected when:", "runs": [{"text": "Anaphylaxis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "diagnosis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "suspected"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "when:"}]}, {"id": "body-00889", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Acute onset involving skin, mucosal tissue, with either respiratory compromise or blood pressure reduction (or syncope)", "runs": [{"text": "Acute"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "onset"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "involving"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "skin,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mucosal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "tissue,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "either"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "respiratory"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "compromise"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "blood"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pressure reduction (or syncope)"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1871"}}, {"id": "body-00890", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Hypotension after exposure to a known allergy for the patient (SBP <90mmHg or >30% from baseline)", "runs": [{"text": "Hypotension"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "after"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "exposure"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "known"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "allergy"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(SBP"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "<90mmHg"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": ">30%"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "from"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "baseline)"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1871"}}, {"id": "body-00891", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Respiratory compromise (i.e., dyspnea, stridor, wheeze, hypoxemia)", "runs": [{"text": "Respiratory"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "compromise"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(i.e.,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "dyspnea,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stridor,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "wheeze,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hypoxemia)"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1871"}}, {"id": "body-00892", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Exposure to a likely allergen causes involvement of the skin, mucosal, respiratory compromization or blood pressure reduction", "runs": [{"text": "Exposure to a likely allergen causes involvement of the skin, mucosal, respiratory compromization or blood pressure reduction"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1871"}}, {"id": "body-00893", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Investigations", "runs": [{"text": "Investigations"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-00894", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Blood gases, Serum Electrolytes, POC ECG, Troponin, CXR and/or POC USS", "runs": [{"text": "Blood"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "gases,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Serum"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Electrolytes,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "POC"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ECG,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Troponin,"}, {"text": " "}, {"t